  "kv8.10:13.7": "katamakkhandhapariyāpannanti. ",
  "kv8.10:13.8": "saṅkhārakkhandhapariyāpannanti. ",
  "kv8.10:13.9": "asaññasattānaṃ natthī saṅkhārakkhandho’ti. ",
  "kv8.10:13.10": "na hevaṃ vattabbe …pe… ",
  "kv8.10:14.1": "asaññasattānaṃ atthī saṅkhārakkhandho’ti. ",
  "kv8.10:14.2": "āmantā. ",
  "kv8.10:14.3": "asaññasattānaṃ atthī vedanākkhandho …pe… ",
