  "kv8.10:14.5": "viññāṇakkhandho’ti. ",
  "kv8.10:14.6": "na hevaṃ vattabbe …pe… ",
  "kv8.10:15.1": "asaññasattānaṃ atthī vedanākkhandho …pe… ",
  "kv8.10:15.2": "saññākkhandho …pe… ",
  "kv8.10:15.3": "viññāṇakkhandho’ti. ",
  "kv8.10:15.4": "āmantā. ",
  "kv8.10:15.5": "pañcavokārabhavo’ti. ",
  "kv8.10:15.6": "na hevaṃ vattabbe …pe… sa. pu ",
  "kv8.10:16.1": "upapattesiyena cittena samuṭṭhitaṃ jīvitindriyaṃ upapattesiye citte bhijjamāne ekadesaṃ bhijjatī’ti. ",
  "kv8.10:16.2": "āmantā. ",
  "kv8.10:16.3": "upapattesiyena cittena samuṭṭhito phasso uppattesiye citte bhijjamāne ekadeso bhijjatī’ti. ",
  "kv8.10:16.4": "na hevaṃ vattabbe …pe… sa. pu ",
  "kv8.10:17.1": "upapattesiyena cittena samuṭṭhito phasso uppattesiye citte bhijjamāne avaseso bhijjatī’ti. ",
  "kv8.10:17.2": "āmantā. ",
  "kv8.10:17.3": "upapattesiyena cittena samuṭṭhito jīvitindriyaṃ uppattesiye citte bhijjamāne anavasesaṃ bhijjatī’ti. ",
  "kv8.10:17.4": "na hevaṃ vattabbe …pe… ",
  "kv8.10:18.1": "dve jīvitindriyānī’ti. ",
  "kv8.10:18.2": "āmantā ",
  "kv8.10:18.3": "dvīhi jīvitehi jīvati, dvīhi maraṇehi mīyatī’ti. ",
  "kv8.10:18.4": "āmantā ",
  "kv8.10:18.5": "jīvitindriyakathā niṭṭhitā. "
